<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">把一份心意送到现场</text><view class="title">帮助</view><view class="subtitle">这里仅展示已经人工审核、正在等待回应的真实心愿。提交响应后，运营人员会再与合适的人联系。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card muted">正在加载真实心愿…</view><view wx:elif="{{error && !selected}}" class="card"><text class="error">{{error}}</text><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><view wx:elif="{{wishes.length}}" wx:for="{{wishes}}" wx:key="id" class="wish-card"><view class="wish-top"><text class="status">{{item.statusLabel}}</text><text class="reward">{{item.rewardText}}</text></view><text class="wish-place">{{item.city}} · {{item.landmark}}</text><text class="wish-message">{{item.message}}</text><text class="wish-meta">{{item.occasion}} · {{item.deadlineText}}</text><button class="secondary-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="respond">我愿意帮助</button></view><view wx:else class="card"><text class="empty-title">暂时没有等待回应的心愿</text><text class="muted">新的心愿须先经过人工审核，再出现在这里。</text></view>
<view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="mask"><view class="sheet"><text class="card-title">回应这份心愿</text><text class="muted">{{selected.city}} · {{selected.landmark}}</text><label class="label">你的称呼</label><input class="input" data-key="name" value="{{name}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="仅运营与撮合联系使用"/><label class="label">联系方式</label><input class="input" data-key="contact" value="{{contact}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="仅运营与撮合联系使用"/><label class="label">想补充的话（可选）</label><textarea class="textarea" data-key="note" value="{{note}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="160"/><text class="notice">提交时会调用微信登录。你的联系方式不会出现在公开页面。</text><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text><button class="primary-button" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">登录微信并提交响应</button><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="close">取消</button></view></view></view><bottom-nav active="help" />
